---
description: Serbian full female name — a single given name and a single surname (Ана Петровић). Note that the surname is drawn from sr.person.lastName, the SAME list a man's is drawn from, not from a feminine list: Serbian surnames do not inflect for gender, so Ана and her brother Марко are both Петровић. That is the whole reason this pack has no person/female/lastName — compare pl, where the equivalent file must read the feminine -ska list.
generator: tdc
locale: sr
---
<sequence name="p">
  <gen name="f" type="template" value="sr.person.female.firstName"/>
  <gen name="l" type="template" value="sr.person.lastName"/>
</sequence>
<data>${{p.f}} ${{p.l}}</data>
